*** Settings ***
Documentation       Generic checks of data in the database - these keywords are used in tests.
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/interactions/database_interactions.resource


*** Keywords ***
Query Should Return
    [Documentation]    Runs an SQL query and checks the first value of the first row.
    [Arguments]    ${sql}    ${expected}
    ${rows}    Read Rows    ${sql}
    Should Not Be Empty    ${rows}    The query returns no row
    Should Be Equal As Strings    ${rows}[0][0]    ${expected}

Table Should Have Rows
    [Documentation]    Checks how many rows a table has.
    [Arguments]    ${table}    ${count}
    ${rows}    Read Rows    SELECT COUNT(*) FROM ${table}
    Should Be Equal As Integers    ${rows}[0][0]    ${count}
{%- if database_driver != 'sqlite' %}

Database Should Respond
    [Documentation]    Checks that the database answers a simple query.
    ${rows}    Read Rows    ${DB_PING_SQL}
    Should Not Be Empty    ${rows}
{%- endif %}
